# W8 `/permissions remember` and `revoke` (research §`/permissions`,
# `permissions3.cap`): a turn first, because xfx opens its saved session at
# the first prompt where fx has one from launch; then the confirmation band,
# Escape, a remembered deny confirmed, the listing, a revoke confirmed, and
# the session's `permissions.json` after.
gateway allowlist-hello.json
wait 2
type hello
key Enter
wait 2
type /permissions remember allow write_file {"path":"a.txt","content":"x"}
key Enter
wait 1.5
snap remember-prompt
key Escape
wait 0.6
snap remember-esc
type /permissions remember deny write_file {"path":"b.txt","content":"y"}
key Enter
wait 1.5
key Enter
wait 1
snap remember-confirmed
type /permissions
key Enter
wait 1
snap listed
type /permissions revoke 1
key Enter
wait 1.5
snap revoke-prompt
key Enter
wait 1
snap revoke-done
type /permissions revoke 99
key Enter
wait 1
type /permissions remember
key Enter
wait 1
snap refusals
home files
